{"about_the_game":"TEKKEN 8 is the latest addition to the TEKKEN series, which celebrated its 30th anniversary in 2025, and has now sold over 59 million units worldwide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game features a rich roster of over 32 characters with meticulously detailed high-resolution models that push modern hardware to its limits. Experience exciting battles with new battle features like Heat, or get yourself out of tough situations with powerful ultimate moves known as Rage Arts. With the new control system, Special Style, you can perform powerful combos with just a simple button, making the game even more accessible to newcomers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are many ways to enjoy TEKKEN 8. Become immersed in the longest ongoing storyline in video game history with single-player story mode or fully express yourself with character customization. Create your avatar and take on various arcade challenges or visit the interactive online lobby to face off against players from around the world. And with online battle modes like Ranked Match, you can jump straight into the action.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Want to improve your skills? You can fight against your own or other players' Ghosts that learn a player's fighting style using AI technology. Plus, you can check out battle replays to receive tips and develop new tactics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/80ccde67d4a29904b77b9f62036fd8b0.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/80ccde67d4a29904b77b9f62036fd8b0.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/80ccde67d4a29904b77b9f62036fd8b0.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just relax. You can do it.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/13496fa07c18cf082098cf6c7270b593ac2ab3da.jpg"},{"name":"I'll give you a rematch anytime, guv.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/b4db2a3baf22bbce5ec793f1a695ab6960fb7428.jpg"},{"name":"Please don't tell my father.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/6de909809ba9c53b1885b721de068eb591b1de22.jpg"},{"name":"Excellent!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/c0c52914a8c69638743d0f5540ddddadd272c922.jpg"},{"name":"That was too easy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/4f1a10a50999290e271075065a7bbf5a3497b011.jpg"},{"name":"Outstanding!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/a306e2c585123a4cb3b00aabbaf779207e22fb99.jpg"},{"name":"Behold, the fruits of my labors.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/c0755ac72396ac578bab022709e0e6fa7ccff2a9.jpg"},{"name":"Let the blistering sands consume you.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/f9d0fdeef40bc4aea05e044e14272ca9f3098b3f.jpg"},{"name":"(That's how a true champion fights!)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/6397eac90440bb471dc184fdf3c861df0a9d601b.jpg"},{"name":"What a rush!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1778820/30be5ee1ce0ff98c76ed9f71fd00f582effa0689.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778820?t=1770678135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770678135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770678135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770678135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2524440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Comparison Chart</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/021a4d9a394cdf0975ca6e620c52b6c4.avif?t=1770678135\" width=646 height=362 /></span></p><br><h1>TEKKEN 8 Advanced Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/47e71bcd48620a97fc8c4d94112203fc.avif?t=1770678135\" width=646 height=362 /></span><br>The Advanced Edition includes:<br>\u2022 TEKKEN 8<br>\u2022 3 Additional playable characters <br>- Eddy<br>- Lidia<br>- Heihachi</p><br><h1>TEKKEN 8 Season 2 Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/50e036ea9fe863d9fbcc8e0b49d26827.avif?t=1770678135\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>*This edition does not contain additional content for TEKKEN 8 Season 3.<br>*TEKKEN 8 Season 3 additional content can be purchased with the following product:<br>- Season 3 Pass<br><br>The Season 2 Deluxe Edition includes:<br>\u2022 TEKKEN 8<br>\u2022 8 Additional playable characters<br>- Eddy<br>- Lidia<br>- Heihachi<br>- Clive<br>- Anna<br>- Fahkumram<br>- Armor King<br>- Miary Zo</p><br><h1>TEKKEN 8 Season 2 Ultimate Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/479aa7b9c2d5bf6f96720a1492cbb054.avif?t=1770678135\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><br>*This edition does not contain additional content for TEKKEN 8 Season 3.<br>*TEKKEN 8 Season 3 additional content can be purchased with the following product:<br>- Season 3 Pass<br><br>The Season 2 Ultimate Edition includes:<br>\u2022 TEKKEN 8<br>\u2022 8 Additional playable characters <br>- Eddy<br>- Lidia<br>- Heihachi<br>- Clive<br>- Anna<br>- Fahkumram<br>- Armor King<br>- Miary Zo<br>\u2022 4 Additional battle stages<br>- GENMAJI TEMPLE<br>- PHOENIX GATE<br>- PAC-PIXELS<br>- BAOBAB HORIZON<br>\u2022 Character Costume: Gold Suit Pack<br>\u2022 Avatar Costume: Classic TEKKEN T-Shirt Set<br>\u2022 4 Avatar Skins</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>TEKKEN 8 is the latest addition to the TEKKEN series, which celebrated its 30th anniversary in 2025, and has now sold over 59 million units worldwide.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/dcc9f48bdf4c8a26537723a956d5aed8.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game features a rich roster of over 32 characters with meticulously detailed high-resolution models that push modern hardware to its limits. Experience exciting battles with new battle features like Heat, or get yourself out of tough situations with powerful ultimate moves known as Rage Arts. With the new control system, Special Style, you can perform powerful combos with just a simple button, making the game even more accessible to newcomers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/c558b60d810cf2d635542e2bc8ea9c58.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are many ways to enjoy TEKKEN 8. Become immersed in the longest ongoing storyline in video game history with single-player story mode or fully express yourself with character customization. Create your avatar and take on various arcade challenges or visit the interactive online lobby to face off against players from around the world. And with online battle modes like Ranked Match, you can jump straight into the action.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.poster.avif?t=1770678135\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.webm?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778820/extras/8f8c77e5b2e11bd3c43606255b38ff89.mp4?t=1770678135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Want to improve your skills? You can fight against your own or other players' Ghosts that learn a player's fighting style using AI technology. Plus, you can check out battle replays to receive tips and develop new tactics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide